  "S14" [label="(14,0,0) Currently, photoinduced surface reconstruction is scarcely reported."];
  "S15" [label="(15,0,0) Currently, in all reported cases, the chemical composition of the surface layers remains essentially unchanged."];
  "S16" [label="(16,0,0) Currently, Copper selenide (Cu2Se) is an intrinsic semiconductor."];
  "S17" [label="(17,0,0) Currently, its thin flake is known as a typical two-dimensional (2D) transition metal chalcogenide."];
